	(text "EU sensor board (docs/DESIGN.md D-56, D-70): FR4 1.6 mm in the barrier's printed carrier.\nTP1 / TP2 on the underside: pads under the pin board's sensor spring pins (GND, +5 V).\nJ2 mates the MSR-2's rear connector CN2 (MSR-2 powered through its 5V pin); H5-H7 SMT spacers.\nMK1: top-port PDM microphone; U2: ADAU7002 PDM to I2S (D-83); U1: SHT40 on the MSR-2's I2C.\nH1-H4: holes for the M2 screws into the carrier."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 180 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
